What was ported
---------------
The design and behaviour of the image writing pipeline, the USB Mass Storage
(SCSI Bulk-Only Transport) layer, and the three-screen flow. The Kotlin sources
were rewritten in ArkTS for the HarmonyOS Stage model. No Kotlin code is shared
with or linked from this directory.

What was deliberately not ported
--------------------------------
The optional telemetry / Sentry reporting and the store review prompts of the
Google Play flavor. This module requests no INTERNET permission.

Icon
----
The HarmonyOS port ships the upstream launcher icon unchanged: the two copies
shipped with the app (AppScope/resources/base/media/app_icon.png and
entry/src/main/resources/base/media/startIcon.png) are byte-identical to
app/src/main/res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher.png. design/upstream-icon-192.png and
design/upstream-icon.svg keep the same artwork next to this port for provenance,
so the icon does not have to be duplicated from ../app when reading this
directory on its own.

